<title>SINGAPORE: Want Want proposes 1 for 5 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Want Want proposes 1 for 5 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwanese snack maker Want Want Holdings Ltd said it was proposing a one-for-five bonus issue of new shares.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement with its 1996 results that the issue would lead to an increase of 81.76 million shares or US$16.35 million in the share capital of the company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
